# Architecture

- Layers: `app` routes → feature components → hooks/providers/utils/constants
- Index data only via `BlockbusterDataProvider`
- Charts under `src/components/Charts/`; shared chrome under `Shared/`
- Scoring/LLM logic stays in sibling services — not this client
- See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DATA_CONTRACT.md`, `docs/CHARTS.md`
